---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Litbuy Spreadsheet | Browse Finds"><main class="catalog-page section"><p class="eyebrow">THE FINDS EDIT / DISCOVER</p><div class="catalog-title"><div><h1><span data-home-i18n="hero_spreadsheet">Spreadsheet</span><span>.</span></h1><p data-home-i18n="all_intro">Browse all products in the FindSpreadsheet catalog snapshot.</p></div><a href="https://findspreadsheet.com/" class="outline-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open FindSpreadsheet ↗</a></div><form action="/products/" class="search catalog-search"><span class="search-icon">⌕</span><input name="q" id="query" placeholder="Search the preview selection..." aria-label="Search preview products"/><button data-home-i18n="search">Search ↗</button></form><div class="filters" id="filters"></div><div class="list-meta"><span id="result-count"></span><span>CATALOG PREVIEW · OCT 19, 2026</span></div><div class="products" id="catalog"></div><p class="data-note">This is a historical export, not a live catalog. USD estimates use archived CNY prices and the observed main-site conversion (¥7.26 per $1). Check the source for current prices and availability. Image search ranks products by approximate similarity across indexed photos in this catalog snapshot. QC photos may be unavailable.</p></main><script src="/app.js" is:inline></script></Base>
